t has made available the latest builds of its 64-bit version of Windows XP Professional and Windows Server 2003 Enterprise, which each features a handful of new improvements including the Luna user interface, Windows Messenger, Windows Media ...\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe5942\", \"article_id\": 3800, \"title\": \"Return to Ancient Greece enthralls athletes\", \"description\": \"OLYMPIA, GREECE -- Brad Snyder #39;s shot put travelled just more than 19 metres, but the arc of its flight spanned more than 1,600 years. \"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe5a0a\", \"article_id\": 4000, \"title\": \"Court Deals Blow to Movie Studios (Reuters)\", \"description\": \"Reuters - A federal appeals court on Thursday\\\\delivered a stinging blow to the anti-piracy efforts of major\\\\movie studios and music companies by ruling several Internet\\\\file-sharing software companies are not liable for copyright\\\\infringement.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe60ad\", \"article_id\": 5699, \"title\": \"Phelps: Packing up seven medals\", \"description\": \"ATHENS: Michael Phelps won gold in the 100m butterfly on Friday to take his Olympic medal tally to five gold and two bronze. A medal of any colour now will him equal the record for most medals at a single \"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe60ae\", \"article_id\": 5700, \"title\": \"More Home stories:\", \"description\": \"Great Britain #39;s gold medal tally now stands at five after Leslie Law was handed the individual three day eventing title - in a courtroom.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe61da\", \"article_id\": 6000, \"title\": \" #39;Testosterone oozed from the screen #39;\", \"description\": \"Forget those chariots, this was Rowing Boats Of Fire. The heart-stopping, edge-of-the-seat, photo finish victory for the men #39;s coxless four was without a doubt one of the Great British Sporting Moments.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe6819\", \"article_id\": 7599, \"title\": \"Stereo sun birds study space weather\", \"description\": \"AUSTRALIAN scientists are working with NASA and the French government to create an advanced space weather instrument that will go on board the STEREO (Solar-Terrestrial Relations Observatory) space mission next year.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe681a\", \"article_id\": 7600, \"title\": \"OmniWeb browser takes aim at minority Mac market\", \"description\": \"SUCH an embarrassment of riches. Apple Macintosh users have two new web browsers to choose from. It #39;s a curious market. All Macs come with two free browsers: Microsoft #39;s Internet Explorer 5.2, and Apple #39;s own slick and elegant Safari.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe69aa\", \"article_id\": 8000, \"title\": \"Logicalis Acquires IBM Business Partner STI For \\\\$90 Million\", \"description\": \"BLOOMFIELD HILLS - Logicalis, an international IT integration company, has acquired for \\\\$90 million Solution Technology, a privately held IBM solution provider and one of IBM #39;s top 10 Business Partners.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb937a19c20043bfe988a\", \"article_id\": 20000, \"title\": \"SI.com\", \"description\": \"DETROIT (Ticker) -- A rocky first inning was too much for Denny Bautista to overcome in his first major league start. Craig Monroe had an RBI single in a three-run first inning and added a solo homer off Bautista \"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bfedd49\", \"article_id\": 37599, \"title\": \"Koizumi says N Korea unlikely to test-fire missile\", \"description\": \"TOKYO - Prime Minister Junichiro Koizumi said Thursday that North Korea is unlikely to test-fire another ballistic missile.  quot;I think the possibility of launching one is low, quot; Koizumi told reporters.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bfedd4a\", \"article_id\": 37600, \"title\": \"Incendiary device found on Sydney jet\", \"description\": \"SYDNEY - Australia promised swift action to plug gaps in its air security yesterday after an incendiary device was found on a jet operated by domestic airline Virgin Blue.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bfee6aa\", \"article_id\": 40000, \"title\": \"Into the danger zone\", \"description\": \"AUSTRALIA #39;S involvement in Iraq and terrorism strikes in Southeast Asia have made defence and national security potentially decisive issues for voters as polling day nears.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bff5279\", \"article_id\": 67599, \"title\": \"Treasuries prices initially slip after Philly Fed\", \"description\": \"US Treasury prices initially slipped and then made a slight recovery after the Philadelphia Federal Reserve #39;s business activity index showed surprising strength.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bff527a\", \"article_id\": 67600, \"title\": \"Bank of Canada Sees Economy Close to Full Capacity\", \"description\": \"A export surge has thrust the Canadian economy into high gear and it is running at close to full capacity, the Bank of Canada said on Thursday, explaining its move to \"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bff5bda\", \"article_id\": 70000, \"title\": \"Big formula for farce\", \"description\": \"AS the 2004 season headed into the final lap, farce and boredom were still vying for supremacy, but with the kind of audacious over-taking manoeuvre fans would love to witness on the track, farce darted into the lead to take the chequered flag.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bffc7a9\", \"article_id\": 97599, \"title\": \"Perfect Game\", \"description\": \"All autumn long, Harvard's football team has had its chroniclers thumbing through the archives and blowing the dust off records that go back to the 19th century. Yesterday afternoon, the unbeaten Crimson wrote their own chapter in bold face, throttling archrival Yale, 35-3, before 30,308 at the Stadium to post their best record (10-0) in 103 years and wrap up ...\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bffc7aa\", \"article_id\": 97600, \"title\": \"Sports  amp; Fitness Calendar\", \"description\": \"The following activities will take place in the area this week. Events are listed as space allows.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb938a19c20043bffd10a\", \"article_id\": 100000, \"title\": \"Venezuelan Car-Bomb Suspect Killed, Weapons Found\", \"description\": \" CARACAS, Venezuela (Reuters) - A Venezuelan lawyer  suspected in last week's bombing murder of a top state  prosecutor was killed in a gunfight with police on Tuesday  after he tried to ram detectives with his car and opened fire  on them, officials said.\"}, {\"_id\": \"6a9eb939a19c20043b003cd9\", \"article_id\": 127599, \"title\": \"EBay gets into rentals\", \"description\": \"EBay plans to buy the apartment and home rental service Rent.com for \\\\$415 million, adding to its already exhaustive breadth of offerings.\"}]", "truncated": false}
